11
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:56,000
The gonzo-style satire follows a social media obsessed rideshare driver played by Joe Keery who, in an
attempt to become a viral trash-streamer, livestreams himself murdering passengers.

12
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
